			title: "The Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6AD157FB825F3E4C"]
			description: [
				"A Frostmaw's stillness is not permission to steal carelessly. Prepare for freezing attacks, wide movement and a fight that can punish anyone standing in the wrong lane."
				"Umvuthi and its followers use a very different rhythm of ranged pressure, movement and magical reward. Research the encounter and clear a retreat route before provoking the settlement."
				"Boss powers are trophies with mechanics. Test a new ability away from animals, villagers and fragile builds before adding it to an expedition loadout."
				"Mowzie's Mobs is encounter design: animations announce attacks, arenas shape movement, and rewards reflect learning the pattern. Watch first, control the space, then attack during a real opening."
			]
			id: "315D139892728739"
			rewards: [{
