		{
			dependencies: ["67FACF25579F11E0"]
			description: [
				"Document five creatures from at least three mods. Record biome, behaviour, useful interaction and whether the species belongs in a sanctuary, working homestead or untouched habitat."
				"Photograph them with Exposure where possible. If you collect a specimen, build appropriate space and keep a route for returning it safely."
				"The Chronicle calls this agreement the Wild Concord: explorers may learn from living things without assuming discovery grants ownership."
				"The Wild Concord treats every new creature as a question before it becomes a target. Record habitat, temperament, food, useful interaction, and danger so the server's knowledge grows without emptying its ecosystems."
			]
